BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:philoi-v1-submit-20260820@philoi.app
DTSTAMP:20260814T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260820
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260821
SUMMARY:Philoi v1 - submit to App Store review (DEADLINE)
DESCRIPTION:Target to submit Philoi v1 to Apple (Thu Aug 20). Apple review ~1-3 days, clears the Sept 10 term start with buffer. Prereqs: migrations deployed, shop bugs fixed, RevenueCat + purchase success screen, Forge Pass de-slopped, cosmetics wired, default cosmetics. Aura + Live Activity pill = v1.1 fast-follow. See V1_LAUNCH_PLAN.md.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:philoi-cansbridge-20260905@philoi.app
DTSTAMP:20260814T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260905
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260906
SUMMARY:Cansbridge Fellowship - pitch / demo Philoi
DESCRIPTION:Don't hard-pitch. Demo it, get people on it, ask for brutal feedback, and collect founder intros (other-campus founders who could run a gym table at their school). Frame: "the accountability layer for people who lock in." See MARKETING_PLAN.md.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:philoi-table-laurier-thu@philoi.app
DTSTAMP:20260814T120000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260910T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260910T150000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;COUNT=5
SUMMARY:Philoi table - Laurier gym (your freest day)
DESCRIPTION:Thursday is wide open until your 7pm class - your prime tabling day, home campus. Athletic-complex entrance: poster + QR + "built by me" sign, demo + answer questions, do remote schoolwork between chats. Get people to install AND start a first lock-in on the spot. See MARKETING_PLAN.md.
LOCATION:Wilfrid Laurier University - Athletic Complex, Waterloo ON
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:philoi-table-uw-tue@philoi.app
DTSTAMP:20260814T120000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260915T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260915T140000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;COUNT=5
SUMMARY:Philoi table - UW gym (Tue lunch, before your 2:30 class)
DESCRIPTION:Your free Tuesday window (2.5 hrs before Data Analysis at 2:30). UW is ~5 min from Laurier. Same setup: "built by a Laurier student, expanding to Waterloo." Or hire a rep to staff UW while you cover Laurier. See MARKETING_PLAN.md.
LOCATION:University of Waterloo - PAC / CIF gym, Waterloo ON
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:philoi-gym-permission-reminder@philoi.app
